<ResearchLayout title="Investment｜J 的世界 Research" page="P6">
<div class="editorial-page">
  <div class="page-kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P6</div>
  <div class="page-meta"><span>SIGNAL <b>Investment</b></span><span>EVIDENCE <b>FACTS FIRST</b></span><span>FOCUS <b>AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</b></span></div>
  <h1 class="page-title">技術節點，如何轉換成產業觀察？</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">PROCESS · PACKAGING · OPTICAL · MATERIALS · INFRASTRUCTURE · SYSTEM</p>
  <div class="editorial-rule"></div>
  <div class="lead-grid">
    <div class="lead-visual"><div class="visual-label">INVESTMENT MATRIX</div><div class="visual-icon-grid six"><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">01</div><b>PROCESS</b><small>製程</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">02</div><b>PACKAGING</b><small>封裝</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">03</div><b>OPTICAL</b><small>光互連</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">04</div><b>MATERIALS</b><small>材料設備</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">05</div><b>INFRA</b><small>電力散熱</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">06</div><b>SYSTEM</b><small>AI Platform</small></div></div><div class="visual-big">TECH<br><em>→ VALUE</em></div></div><aside class="lead-note"><span class="tag">INVESTMENT</span><h2>不是把技術直接等同於股票，而是把技術節點轉換成可驗證的產業鏈觀察。</h2><p>研究框架從製程、封裝、光互連、材料設備、電力散熱一路連到 AI Platform。</p></aside>
  </div>
  <div class="j-insight"><span class="insight-label">J 的解讀 · FROM TECHNOLOGY TO INDUSTRY</span><h3>技術節點不是股票答案，而是產業觀察的起點。</h3><p>例如先進封裝出現，我們下一步不是直接找「封裝股」，而是拆解誰提供材料、設備、製程能力，再看哪些公司已進入驗證、導入或量產。這樣才能把技術訊號轉成可驗證的產業鏈。</p><small>Investment Matrix 是研究分類工具，不等同於投資評等。</small></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">MATRIX</div><h2>六個研究層級</h2></div></div><div class="matrix"><div class="cell"><b>PROCESS</b><h3>先進製程</h3><p>製程節點、產能、設備與材料需求。</p></div><div class="cell"><b>PACKAGING</b><h3>先進封裝</h3><p>CoWoS、SoIC、Chiplet 與異質整合。</p></div><div class="cell"><b>OPTICAL</b><h3>光互連</h3><p>CPO、光引擎、光纖與高速互連。</p></div><div class="cell"><b>MATERIALS</b><h3>材料與設備</h3><p>真正進入製程、驗證與量產的供應商。</p></div><div class="cell"><b>INFRASTRUCTURE</b><h3>電力與散熱</h3><p>AI Server 與資料中心的基礎設施瓶頸。</p></div><div class="cell"><b>SYSTEM</b><h3>AI Platform</h3><p>整個系統的效能、功耗與成本。</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH RULE</div><h2>從技術走到產業，不跳步</h2></div></div><div class="quote">技術出現 ≠ 商業化。真正需要追蹤的是 <strong>驗證 → 導入 → 量產 → 擴散</strong>。</div></section>
  
</div>
</ResearchLayout>
